{"id":"word:hebrew:H123","type":"word","title":"אֱדֹם","subtitle":"H123 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Edom , the elder twin-brother of Jacob; hence the region (Idumaea) occupied by him","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אֱדֹם (H123) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 100 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אֱדֹם (ʼĔdôm) means Edom , the elder twin-brother of Jacob; hence the region (Idumaea) occupied by him First listed occurrence: 1Chr 1 43."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אֱדֹם","transliteration":"ʼĔdôm","pronunciation":"ed-ome'","strong":"H123","lemmaId":"hebrew:H123","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-m","forms":["אֱד֔וֹם","אֱדֽוֹם","אֱדוֹם֙","אֱד֖וֹם","אֱד֑וֹם"],"morphs":[["HNp",81],["HR/Np",16],["HC/R/Np",2],["HC/Np",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"Edom , the elder twin-brother of Jacob; hence the region (Idumaea) occupied by him","usage":"Edom, Edomites, Idumea.","full":"H123. edom אֱדֹם noun [masculine] name of a condiment (Arabic see Anderson in Di; compare Assyrian adumatu ? Dl W ) ׳הָאֱ Gen 25:30 (twice in verse) (J; so read for ׳הָאָ MT; see Di). אֱדוֺם ( אֱדֹם Ezek 25:14 ) proper name, masculine 1. Edom (name of a god ? see Sta G. 1, 121 RS Sem 43 ; see n.pr. עבדאדם ; but Bae Rel 10 thinks dialect variant reading of אדום בני אָדָם, = אָדָם בְנֵי ) = Esau, elderson of Isaac Gen 25:30 (J) (where etymology = red , compare 25:25 (E ?) & below אַדְמוֺנִי 36:1 , 8 , 19 (P). 2 collective ( masculine but feminine Mal 1:4 ) Edomites, Idumeans as descendants of Esau Gen 36:9 , 43 (P); also 1Sam 14:47 31 t. + 2Sam 8:13 (for ארם ᵑ0 ; ᵑ6 ᵐ5 see 1Chr 18:12 ; Psa 60:2 , We Dr); perhaps also 60:12 ( ᵑ6 ᵐ5 1Chr 18:11 ; ארם ᵑ0 but see We Dr); also 2Chr 20:2 (see Berthau); ׳א = king of Edom Num 20:18 , 20 , 21 ; in poetry א ׳בְּנֵי Psa 137:7 א ׳בַּת Lam 4:21-22 , 3 land of Edom, Idumaea ( f. Ezek 32:29 ; 35:15 ; and 36:5 ) south & southeast of Palestine Gen 36:32 , 43 32 t. (including ׳א שְׂדֵה 32:4 ; א ׳אֶרֶץ 36:16-17 , 21 , 31 ; Num 20:23 ; 21:4 ; 33:37 +); — uncertain weather 2 or 3 are Exod 15:15 ; Num 20:14 ; 24:18 9 t. (chiefly in א ׳מֶלֶח etc.) **See now FBuhl Geschichte. d. Edomiter (1893) .","rootNote":"or (fully) אֱדוֹם ; from 122 ; red (see Genesis 25:25);","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 1 43","keyReferences":["1Chr 1 43","1Chr 1 51","1Chr 1 54","1Chr 18 11","1Chr 18 12","1Chr 18 13","1Chr 18 13","1Kgs 9 26"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":100,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 1 43","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":43,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֱד֔וֹם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 1 51","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":51,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֱד֔וֹם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 1 54","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":54,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֱדֽוֹם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 18 11","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵֽ/אֱד֤וֹם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 18 12","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֱדוֹם֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 18 13","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בֶּֽ/אֱדוֹם֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 18 13","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֱד֖וֹם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 9 26","book":"1Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֱדֽוֹם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 11 14","book":"1Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בֶּ/אֱדֽוֹם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Kgs 11 15","book":"1Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":15,"englishText